Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 17:43:14 2026 +1100

    l3: Check the function bodies in the HA router
    
    The readers of ha_port and keepalived_manager go through one accessor
    each, which raises a RuntimeError naming the attribute if it is unset,
    rather than an AttributeError or TypeError on None. enable_conntrackd()
    and external_gateway_updated() check conntrackd_manager and ex_gw_port.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (high effort)
    Change-Id: I1113efc375d1edf459bb706ea8bae4b14413b540
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

